1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,600
Some settings are on the login screen, before you log in. Click the gear.

2
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:11,460
If your network needs a proxy to reach the internet, tick this box and enter its details.

3
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:16,820
An alternate server is used if your main server cannot be reached. Your broker gives you these.

4
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:21,240
Theme picks dark or light before you even log in.

5
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:27,730
Entries lets you add a server that is not in the list, using details from your broker.

6
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:30,980
Click Save to keep your changes, or Cancel to leave them as they were.

